Package: bencrannich-anchors
Version: 26.11.22-3
Section: site
Depends: ca-certificates
Priority: required
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Ben Crannich Operations <operations@BENCRANNICH.NET>
Description: Ben Crannich trust anchors
  This package contains the site-wide trust anchors (CA certificates) for Ben Crannich.
  .
  Upon installation, the certificates are added to /etc/ca-certificates.conf and activated.
  .
  If the certificates are already listed (but deactivated), they will not be
  automatically re-activated.
